Third-Party Licenses

This sample does not vendor (bundle) any third-party source code. The runtime
dependencies below are fetched at build time by pip (see app/requirements.txt
and a2a-bridge/requirements.txt), and the container base image is pulled from
the public Amazon ECR mirror at build time (see app/Dockerfile). They are listed
here for transparency and attribution.

